Third-party components
----------------------

The application depends on, but does not redistribute:

    CadQuery           Apache-2.0     the OCCT-based CAD kernel
    cq_gears           Apache-2.0     involute gear geometry
    cq_warehouse       Apache-2.0     fasteners, sprockets, threads
    anthropic          MIT            the model client
    boto3              Apache-2.0     AWS credential resolution for Bedrock
    FastAPI, uvicorn   MIT            the web server
    VTK                BSD            offscreen rendering
    three.js           MIT            vendored in app/web/vendor/

app/tools/check_standards.py verifies our dimension tables against BOLTS
(boltsparts/boltsparts). BOLTS data is LGPL-2.1+ and its tooling GPL-3.0.
None of it is copied into this repository and nothing here depends on it —
the tool reads a checkout supplied at runtime and reports agreement or
disagreement. A dimension is a fact and cannot be copyrighted; a compilation
of them can be, which is why that tool verifies rather than vendors.
